# anthropic_api_keys (Data Source)

Lists Anthropic API keys via the Admin API. All pages are fetched automatically.

Results can optionally be filtered by `status` (`active`, `inactive`, `archived` or `expired`), by `workspace_id` and by `created_by_user_id`.

> **API**: `GET /v1/organizations/api_keys` (Admin API).
> **Auth**: Admin API key (`admin_api_key` / `ANTHROPIC_ADMIN_API_KEY`): a Claude Console Admin API key, or a personal or service account key not scoped to a workspace. Not available to Claude Enterprise organizations.
> **Beta header**: None.
> **Cost**: Free.

> **`api_keys[*].workspace_id` is deprecated:** use `scope.workspace_id` instead, which carries the real workspace ID for keys in the Default Workspace too. `workspace_id` is null both for organization-scoped keys and for keys in the Default Workspace, and Admin API version 2026-10-21 removes it. Terraform (checked with 1.16 and 1.17) shows no deprecation warning for a reference through the list (`api_keys[0].workspace_id`, a splat or a `for` expression), so this page is the only notice.

